      "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that Black people are intellectually inferior, which is a form of racism. The phrase 'shit for brains' is an intelligence-related slur targeting the woman's perceived cognitive abilities, which is a common racist trope used to demean Black individuals. This stereotype is not visible in the image but is required to understand the hateful intent of the meme.",
