      "description": "The target audience consists of individuals who hold racist, misogynistic, and Islamophobic views, particularly those who engage in online hate speech and targeted attacks against public figures of color, especially Black Muslim women in positions of power. The meme is designed to appeal to communities that perpetuate stereotypes about Black intellectual inferiority, gendered incompetence, and religiously motivated mockery, using crude language and visual juxtaposition to reinforce these biases.",
